GRAY  |  OpenCV color format. [VideoReader](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/db/ded/classcv_1_1cudacodec_1_1VideoReader.html "Video reader interface, see createVideoReader\(\).") and [VideoWriter](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/df/dde/classcv_1_1cudacodec_1_1VideoWriter.html "Video writer interface, see createVideoWriter\(\).").   
RGB  |  OpenCV color format. [VideoReader](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/db/ded/classcv_1_1cudacodec_1_1VideoReader.html "Video reader interface, see createVideoReader\(\).") and [VideoWriter](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/df/dde/classcv_1_1cudacodec_1_1VideoWriter.html "Video writer interface, see createVideoWriter\(\).").   
RGBA  |  OpenCV color format. [VideoReader](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/db/ded/classcv_1_1cudacodec_1_1VideoReader.html "Video reader interface, see createVideoReader\(\).") and [VideoWriter](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/df/dde/classcv_1_1cudacodec_1_1VideoWriter.html "Video writer interface, see createVideoWriter\(\).").   
NV_YUV_SURFACE_FORMAT  |  Nvidia YUV Surface Format output by the Nvidia decoder, see [SurfaceFormat](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d0/d61/group__cudacodec.html#gaaac1ece32d7b3efa9afc9811315d35cb). [VideoReader](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/db/ded/classcv_1_1cudacodec_1_1VideoReader.html "Video reader interface, see createVideoReader\(\).") only.   
NV_NV12  |  Nvidia Buffer Format - Semi-Planar YUV [Y plane followed by interleaved UV plane]. [VideoWriter](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/df/dde/classcv_1_1cudacodec_1_1VideoWriter.html "Video writer interface, see createVideoWriter\(\).") only.  


    Deprecated for use with [VideoReader](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/db/ded/classcv_1_1cudacodec_1_1VideoReader.html "Video reader interface, see createVideoReader\(\)."), use [NV_YUV_SURFACE_FORMAT](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d0/d61/group__cudacodec.html#ggadec0c48107aa8350a98f91dce063dbe9a553a79e0a2c42bf02ddb88bfd2ebff24) instead.   
NV_YV12  |  Nvidia Buffer Format - Planar YUV [Y plane followed by V and U planes]. [VideoWriter](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/df/dde/classcv_1_1cudacodec_1_1VideoWriter.html "Video writer interface, see createVideoWriter\(\).") only.   
NV_IYUV  |  Nvidia Buffer Format - Planar YUV [Y plane followed by U and V planes]. [VideoWriter](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/df/dde/classcv_1_1cudacodec_1_1VideoWriter.html "Video writer interface, see createVideoWriter\(\).") only.   
NV_YUV444  |  Nvidia Buffer Format - Planar YUV [Y plane followed by U and V planes]. [VideoWriter](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/df/dde/classcv_1_1cudacodec_1_1VideoWriter.html "Video writer interface, see createVideoWriter\(\).") only.   
NV_AYUV  |  Nvidia Buffer Format - 8 bit Packed A8Y8U8V8. This is a word-ordered format where a pixel is represented by a 32-bit word with V in the lowest 8 bits, U in the next 8 bits, Y in the 8 bits after that and A in the highest 8 bits. [VideoWriter](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/df/dde/classcv_1_1cudacodec_1_1VideoWriter.html "Video writer interface, see createVideoWriter\(\).") only.   
NV_YUV420_10BIT  |  Nvidia Buffer Format - 10 bit Semi-Planar YUV [Y plane followed by interleaved UV plane]. Each pixel of size 2 bytes. Most Significant 10 bits contain pixel data. [VideoWriter](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/df/dde/classcv_1_1cudacodec_1_1VideoWriter.html "Video writer interface, see createVideoWriter\(\).") only.   
NV_YUV444_10BIT  |  Nvidia Buffer Format - 10 bit Planar YUV444 [Y plane followed by U and V planes]. Each pixel of size 2 bytes. Most Significant 10 bits contain pixel data. [VideoWriter](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/df/dde/classcv_1_1cudacodec_1_1VideoWriter.html "Video writer interface, see createVideoWriter\(\).") only.   
