  * Output [cv::GMat](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/df/daa/classcv_1_1GMat.html "GMat class represents image or tensor data in the graph.") has been transformed into extra output parameter, thus `GCPUFilter2D::run()` takes one argument more than the original kernel signature.


