The following code demonstrates its usage for a 2-d matrix: 
[cv::Mat](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d3/d63/classcv_1_1Mat.html) mat(20, 1, [CV_32FC2](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d1/d1b/group__core__hal__interface.html#ga15d6109d87682bf909122d0ce51c46a6));
