Returns an array of all 1's of the specified size and type. 
The method returns a Matlab-style 1's array initializer, similarly to [Mat::zeros](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d3/d63/classcv_1_1Mat.html#a56daa006391a670e9cb0cd08e3168c99 "Returns a zero array of the specified size and type."). Note that using this method you can initialize an array with an arbitrary value, using the following Matlab idiom: 
